We present this elegant new-build 2-bedroom apartment, designed to provide comfort, energy efficiency, and quality of life. With modern finishes and high-quality materials, this unit stands out for the functionality of its spaces and the attention to detail in every aspect.

Among the main highlights of the property are:

- Apartment with one en-suite bedroom and one additional bedroom;

- Two bathrooms with wall-hung sanitary ware;

- Air conditioning in the living room and bedrooms;

- Open-plan living room;

- Furnished and equipped kitchen;

- Spacious balcony;

- Private garage;

This apartment is located in a quiet area, close to the river beach and just a few meters from shops and services.

An excellent opportunity for those looking for a modern apartment.

